      "sourceArea": "markdown_rendering"
    },
    {
      "id": "dec-f0dfaad0-c1a3-4d44-b16f-8da9e86c3f53",
      "area": "project_overview",
      "statement": "采用 Vitest + React Testing Library + fake-indexeddb 构建端到端与单元测试体系。",
      "decisionKey": "delivery.test_framework",
      "rationale": "Vitest 与 Vite 共享同一套配置与转换管线，冷启动极其迅速，开箱支持 TypeScript；搭配 fake-indexeddb 能够在 Node.js 环境中对 Dexie.js 与 IndexedDB 的复杂事务、多值索引进行毫秒级无头单元测试，无需耗时的浏览器拉起开销。",
